WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.420
&gt;&gt;&gt; This morning, title 42 is no longer.

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:14.139
It was used three million times to turn migrants
way from the U.S.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:17.220
Now immigration officials are bracing for
what comes next.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:22.000
Border patrol chief says tens of thousands
of migrants are at the bored we are thousands

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.710
more coming.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:27.920
These are live pictures from Arizona where
we're watching the line grow.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.179
We should mention it's not even 5:00 A.M.

00:00:30.179 --> 00:00:31.179
There yet.

00:00:31.179 --> 00:00:34.840
Joining us now is homeland security secretary
Alejandro mayorkas.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:41.840
Mr. Secretary, president met with you yesterday
with the secretary Anthony blinken and Lloyd

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:42.840
Austin.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:47.219
As you see this play out, where do things
stand?

00:00:47.219 --> 00:00:51.610
Can you update us on what you've seen so far
seven hours into this new reality?

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:52.740
&gt;&gt; Good morning.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:53.870
[7:42:54 AM]

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:55.000
&gt;&gt; Good morning.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.210
We are seeing people arrive at our southern
border as we expected, as we have been planning

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:03.210
for.

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.250
We're taking them into our custody.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.900
We are processing them.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.210
We are screening and vetting them.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:16.509
And if they do not have a basis to remain,
we will remove them very swiftly under now

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:21.780
what we can use are traditional immigration
enforcement authorities.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.210
We've been very, very clear.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:29.860
There are lawful, safe and ordererly pathways
to seek relief in the United States.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:35.649
And if one arrives at our southern border
when it is going to face tougher consequences

00:01:35.649 --> 00:01:38.600
and that is what we're going to deliver.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:43.710
&gt;&gt; A federal judge yesterday ruled or stripped
your ability to release migrants without court

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:44.710
dates.

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:49.190
First, you plan to appeal that ruling.

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:50.330
&gt;&gt; It's a very harmful ruling.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.460
The department of justice is considering our
options.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.460
The practice that the court has

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:55.460
[7:43:55 AM]

00:01:55.460 --> 00:02:00.869
The practice that the court has prevented
us from using is a practice that prior administrations

00:02:00.869 --> 00:02:02.140
have used.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.990
To relieve overcrowding.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:09.289
What we do is we process, screen, and vet
individuals.

00:02:09.289 --> 00:02:14.849
If we do not hold them, we release them so
that they can go into immigration enforcement

00:02:14.849 --> 00:02:18.450
proceedings, make whatever claim for relief
they might.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.530
The if they don't succeed, be removed.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:26.180
&gt;&gt; Can I ask you, given that whether it is
temporary or how long it lasts, given the

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:30.470
court order, what are you doing to prepare
for overcrowding?

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:35.620
You are prepared to deal with the fact that
you're going to have to continue to hold more

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.510
people because of what the court has done?

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:43.659
Do you have the facilities, the resources
necessary to deal with what could be a new

00:02:43.659 --> 00:02:46.819
influx of people you need to hold?

00:02:46.819 --> 00:02:49.380
&gt;&gt; A couple things.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.710
Number one, we've been planning for months.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.319
We've been executing on those plans.

00:02:53.319 --> 00:02:54.319
We have searched personnel.

00:02:54.319 --> 00:02:55.319
We have added facility capacity.

00:02:55.319 --> 00:02:56.319
[7:44:56 AM]

00:02:56.319 --> 00:02:59.290
We have added facility capacity.

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:02.370
We have surged transportation resources.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.819
We will manage through the situation.

00:03:04.819 --> 00:03:09.510
But really what the situation reflects is
the fact that we are operating within very

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:11.280
serious constraints.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:17.540
And the two primary constraints are as follows
-- one, a fundamentally broken immigration

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:21.230
system that hasn't been fixed for more than
two decades.

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.890
And we need congress to act.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:30.830
Two, we need congress to provide us with the
resources that we need that, we requested,

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.030
and that we haven't received.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:33.030
&gt;&gt; Can you explain that?

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:37.091
I think one thing that people have a difficult
time getting heads around is you saying can,

00:03:37.091 --> 00:03:42.489
which is true, you've been preparing for this
for months and it's been an inevitability.

00:03:42.489 --> 00:03:49.379
And, yet, the president noted that they would
likely be chaotic is not a good read on whether

00:03:49.379 --> 00:03:52.890
or not the preparation is going to be enough,
especially in the short term.

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:57.000
How is that possible if you had so much time
to prepare and yet still are not totally sure

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.000
you'll be able to basically not

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.000
[7:45:57 AM]

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:04.150
you'll be able to basically not have some
type of chaotic situation at the border?

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:08.910
&gt;&gt; I've been very clear for months that the
situation is going to be challenging.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:15.770
When we transition from the public health
authority of title 42 to our immigration enforcement

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:16.770
authorities.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.489
I've been very, very clear and open about
that.

00:04:19.489 --> 00:04:22.790
I've also been very clear that we have confidence
in our plan.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:25.130
The our plan will take some time.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.900
But our plan will succeed.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:31.039
And I say that with confidence because our
plan is worked in the past.

00:04:31.039 --> 00:04:41.870
The president extended lawful, safe, and orderly
pathways for individuals from Cuba and Nicaragua.

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:46.600
And those individuals from those countries
that didn't use the pathways, he can delivered

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:48.160
a tougher consequence.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:54.949
We saw a more than 90% drop in the number
of encounters of those individuals.

00:04:54.949 --> 00:04:56.850
In a matter of days.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:57.850
So we've seen success.

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:58.850
[7:46:58 AM]

00:04:58.850 --> 00:04:59.850
So we've seen success.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:00.850
We'll achieve success.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:02.590
It will take time.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:09.760
And to avoid -- to avoid the number of people
arriving at our southern border, we need to

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.770
fix the broken immigration system.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:18.840
And, by the way, a broken immigration system
that was dismantled by the prior administration.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:19.960
&gt;&gt; No, I understand.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:24.090
I know it's been a difficult two plus years
trying to put together the plans that you

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.590
wanted to implement when it comes to that
system.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:29.980
I do want to ask, one of the biggest issues
when you talk to officials on the ground,

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:33.020
federal, state, local, the disinformation.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:35.229
The information that you guys are trying to
get out.

00:05:35.229 --> 00:05:36.670
You put out a statement last night.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:39.040
You've been very clear the border is not open.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:43.130
One of the colleagues says it appears the
department of homeland security is making

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:46.660
a clear effort to showcase the law enforcement
efforts.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:51.300
Federal agents and flack jackets and handcuffs
walking around sacred heart church asking

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.790
migrants to turn themselves N they are giving
access to reporters.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.539
I think the Obama administration does that
as well.

00:05:57.539 --> 00:05:58.539
Is it intentional?

00:05:58.539 --> 00:05:59.539
[7:47:59 AM]

00:05:59.539 --> 00:06:00.539
Is it intentional?

00:06:00.539 --> 00:06:04.639
Are you trying to make very clear from a kind
of more muscular law enforcement perspective

00:06:04.639 --> 00:06:11.280
through pictures that this is not what maybe
people are hearing from the other side of

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:12.570
the border?

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:19.550
&gt;&gt; We have an obligation to counter the ruthless
actions of the smuggling organizations.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:26.090
Not only do they inflict tragedy and trauma
on the migrants, on vulnerable individuals,

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:28.960
but they spread misinformation.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:36.199
They spread lies to deceive those vulnerable
individuals into placing their lives and life

00:06:36.199 --> 00:06:41.590
savings in the hands of criminals that only
care about profit and not people.

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:46.009
So, we have been communicating for months
accurate information.

00:06:46.009 --> 00:06:53.070
And we've been building on the communications
and only amplifying and enhancing our efforts.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:57.530
Just a couple days ago we announced a new
digital campaign.

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:01.090
We've got to send accurate information to
the migrants so

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:02.090
[7:49:00 AM]

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:05.660
information to the migrants so they're not
deceived and lied to and possibly lose their

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.620
lives at the hands of really ruthless

